WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.409
Pixton's completeness conjecture fails.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.753
Pixton listed relations among tautological classes and

3
00:00:05.753 --> 00:00:08.112
conjectured they are all of them.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.592
An alternating product of small diagonals vanishes,

5
00:00:11.592 --> 00:00:13.814
but is not in Pixton's span.

6
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.522
Claimed: a missing relation, in Chow and cohomology.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.221
No Lean proof yet.
